  "description": "Independent legal marketing consultant for law firms across Tampa Bay: Hillsborough, Pinellas, Pasco and Manatee counties. Cost per retained client, agency accountability, intake and strategy.",
  "url": url,
  "telephone": "+17274833222",
  "email": "joe@hugheyllc.com",
  "image": "https://hugheyllc.com/images/logo.png",
  "priceRange": "$$",
  "parentOrganization": { "@id": "https://hugheyllc.com/#business" },
  "address": {
    "@type": "PostalAddress",
    "streetAddress": "5412 Dover St NE",
    "addressLocality": "St. Petersburg",
    "addressRegion": "FL",
    "postalCode": "33703",
    "addressCountry": "US"
  },
  "geo": { "@type": "GeoCoordinates", "latitude": 27.8206, "longitude": -82.6331 },
  "openingHours": ["Mo-Fr 09:00-17:00"],
  "areaServed": [
    { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Hillsborough County, FL" },
    { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Pinellas County, FL" },
    { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Pasco County, FL" },
    { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Manatee County, FL" }
  ],
  "serviceType": ["Legal marketing consulting", "Law firm marketing strategy", "Marketing attribution", "Agency management", "Intake optimization"],
  "sameAs": [
    "https://www.linkedin.com/in/joehughey/",
    "https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61577138003264"
  ]
};

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Where is Hughey LLC located?',
    a: 'Our office is at 5412 Dover St NE, St. Petersburg, FL 33703. We work with law firms throughout Tampa Bay in person and with firms across Florida and the rest of the country remotely.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What does a Tampa Bay legal marketing consultancy do?',
    a: "We audit how a firm's marketing and intake work today, connect ad spend and referrals to signed retainers, hold agencies accountable to that number, fix the intake process, and build a 12-month plan. We don't run ads or build websites. We make sure the people who do are producing clients.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Should a Tampa Bay firm target the whole bay or just its county?',
    a: 'It depends on where your retained clients actually live and how far they will travel. Many firms target the entire media market by default and waste spend across the bridges. Measuring signed clients by ZIP code usually answers the question quickly.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How much does legal marketing consulting cost?',
    a: 'Engagements are hourly or on a monthly retainer, depending on scope. The first step is a free call.',
  },
];
---

<LocalMarketPage
  title="Legal Marketing Tampa Bay | Law Firm Marketing Consultant | Hughey LLC"
  description="Independent legal marketing consultant for Tampa Bay law firms, based in St. Petersburg. Cost per retained client, agency accountability and intake optimization. Free call."
  canonical={url}
  eyebrow="Tampa Bay • Based in St. Petersburg"
  heading="Legal Marketing Consultants<br /><em>Tampa Bay, FL</em>"
  subheading="One bay, four counties, two very different legal markets. We help Tampa Bay firms see which marketing produces signed clients and cut what doesn't."
  crumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: 'https://hugheyllc.com/' },
    { name: 'Florida', url: 'https://hugheyllc.com/florida/' },
    { name: 'Tampa Bay', url },
  ]}
  businessSchema={businessSchema}
  serviceArea="Tampa • St. Petersburg • Clearwater • Brandon • Largo • Wesley Chapel • New Port Richey • Bradenton • Hillsborough, Pinellas, Pasco and Manatee counties"
  practiceAreas={["Personal Injury", "Family Law & Divorce", "Estate Planning", "Probate & Trust Administration", "Elder Law", "Business & Corporate Law", "Commercial Litigation", "Real Estate", "Employment & Labor", "Immigration", "Bankruptcy & Debt Relief", "Criminal Defense & DUI", "Workers' Compensation", "Medical Malpractice", "Social Security Disability", "Insurance & Property Claims", "Intellectual Property", "Tax Law", "Construction Law", "Condominium & HOA Law", "Maritime & Admiralty", "Health Care Law"]}
  office={true}
  nearby={[
    { label: 'Tampa', href: '/florida/tampa/' },
    { label: 'St. Petersburg', href: '/florida/st-petersburg/' },
    { label: 'Orlando', href: '/florida/orlando/' },
    { label: 'All Florida markets', href: '/florida/' },
  ]}
  faqs={faqs}
  ctaHeading="Tampa Bay Firms: Start With the Numbers"
  ctaText="A free call is the fastest way to find out whether your marketing has a measurement problem, an intake problem or a vendor problem."
>
  <p class="lm-lede">Hughey LLC is a legal marketing consultancy based in St. Petersburg, working with law firms across Tampa Bay. For more than 20 years our work has been limited to one industry: helping law firms turn marketing spend into retained clients.</p>

  <p>We're not an agency. We don't run your ads or build your site. We're the independent layer above your vendors that measures what each channel costs per signed client and makes sure your budget follows the results.</p>

  <h2>Two Markets Sharing One Bay</h2>

  <p>Tampa Bay looks like one market in Google's eyes. The cities share a media market and searchers on either side of the bay see many of the same advertisers. In practice, the legal markets behave differently.</p>

  <div class="lm-facts">
    <div class="lm-fact"><span>Hillsborough</span><strong>Thirteenth Circuit. Larger firms, heavier ad competition. <a href="/florida/tampa/">Tampa page →</a></strong></div>
    <div class="lm-fact"><span>Pinellas and Pasco</span><strong>Sixth Circuit. Boutique firms, referral-driven. <a href="/florida/st-petersburg/">St. Pete page →</a></strong></div>
  </div>

  <p><a href="/florida/tampa/">Tampa</a> has more large and mid-size firms and more paid competition. <a href="/florida/st-petersburg/">St. Petersburg</a> and Clearwater lean toward smaller practices that live on referrals, reviews and the maps pack. Pasco and Manatee are growing fast, with newer residents who have no existing relationship with a local lawyer and start their search online.</p>

  <p>Firms that treat the whole bay as one target usually overpay. A Clearwater estate planning firm and a downtown Tampa employment firm need different geographic targeting, different channels and different intake expectations, even when their agencies sell them the same package.</p>

  <h2>What We Help Tampa Bay Firms Fix</h2>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>No cost-per-retained-client number.</strong> Spend, calls, forms, consults and signed matters tied together by channel. <a href="/services/data-analysis-for-law-firms/">Data analysis</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Agencies that report activity instead of outcomes.</strong> One set of KPIs and regular accountability reviews. <a href="/services/agency-management-for-law-firms/">Agency management</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Leads lost between the call and the consult.</strong> Response time, qualification and follow-up rebuilt around the leads you already pay for. <a href="/services/intake-process-optimization/">Intake optimization</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Reactive spending.</strong> A 12-month plan tied to retained-client targets instead of the latest vendor pitch. <a href="/services/strategic-marketing-for-law-firms/">Strategic marketing</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="lm-pull">Your agencies are paid to be busy. We're paid to find out whether busy is producing clients.</p>

  <h2>Local When It Helps, Remote When It Doesn't</h2>

  <p>Because our office is in St. Petersburg, in-person work anywhere in Tampa Bay is easy: kickoff sessions, intake team training, partner meetings. The ongoing measurement and vendor management happen remotely, which is also how we work with firms elsewhere in <a href="/florida/">Florida</a> and nationally.</p>
</LocalMarketPage>
